sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant L as Leader
    participant W as Workers (N shards)

    C->>L: run(event_count, batch_size)
    L->>W: create shard group
    L->>L: generate fake WAL events

    loop each batch of events
        L->>W: process_batch(events)
        W->>W: skip duplicates, track LSN,<br/>transform each event for:<br/>search, analytics, cache
        W-->>L: sink counts, table counts, compute_ms
    end

    L->>L: total per-sink and per-table counts
    L-->>C: events/sec, timing, duplicates skipped
